      "body": "An undisclosed buyer acquired 8.50% stake in Confidence Petroleum India Limited (BSE:526829) from BW LPG Shipping FZCO on June 3, 2026. Mode of acquisition is off market.  \nAn undisclosed buyer completed the acquisition of 8.50% stake in Confidence Petroleum India Limited (BSE:526829) from BW LPG Shipping FZCO on June 3, 2026.",
