      "date": "2026-06-01T07:50:45.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.79 (vs ₹2.62 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.79 (up from ₹2.62 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹47.1b (up 50% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹928.9m (up 7.7% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 2.0% (down from 2.7% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 14% per year but the company’s share price has remained flat, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
